{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "动画按深度优先顺序展示回溯生成全排列的过程：每层从尚未使用的数字中选择一个加入路径，路径长度等于数组长度时记录答案。返回上一层时撤销刚才的选择，再尝试同层的下一个数字；因为输入元素互不相同，只需用“已使用”状态避免重复选择。示例 [1,2,3] 最终得到 3! = 6 个排列。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>全排列回溯过程</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.step{color:#3794ff;font-size:11px}\n.mono,.num,.path{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.boxes{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.box{min-width:38px;padding:4px 6px;text-align:center;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s}\n.box .num{display:block;font-size:14px}\n.box .label{display:block;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px}\n.box.used{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.box.used .label{color:#d4d4d4}\n.box.available{border-color:#3c3c3c}\n.flow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.frame{padding:6px 8px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;min-height:44px;font-size:11px}\n.frame.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.depth{font-size:10px;color:#3794ff;margin-bottom:2px}\n.frame.active .depth{color:#d4d4d4}\n.action{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;margin-top:8px;min-height:36px;line-height:1.45}\n.answers{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.answer{padding:4px 8px;text-align:center;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px;transition:all .35s}\n.answer.done{color:#d4d4d4;border-color:#3c3c3c}\n.answer.current{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.footer{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;justify-content:space-between;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px;margin-top:8px}\n.counter{color:#3794ff;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>回溯枚举 nums = [1,2,3]</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">选未用数 → 入路径 → 满长记录 → 撤销继续。</p>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span class=\"panel-title\">步骤</span><span id=\"step\" class=\"step\">准备开始</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\">数字状态</div>\n<div id=\"numbers\" class=\"boxes\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\">递归路径</div>\n<div id=\"frames\" class=\"flow\"></div>\n<div id=\"action\" class=\"action\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\">已收集排列</div>\n<div id=\"answers\" class=\"answers\"></div>\n<div class=\"footer\"><span>深度优先</span><span>数量 <strong id=\"count\" class=\"counter\">0 / 6</strong></span><span class=\"mono\">3! = 6</span></div>\n</div>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst nums=[1,2,3],allAnswers=[],stages=[],path=[],used=new Set();\nfunction snap(t,a){stages.push({p:[...path],c:allAnswers.length,t,a});}\nsnap('从空路径开始','每层只选择尚未使用的元素.');\nfunction dfs(){\n if(path.length===nums.length){allAnswers.push([...path]);snap('记录 ['+path.join(',')+']','复制完整路径作为一个答案, 随后逐层撤销选择.');return;}\n for(const n of nums){if(used.has(n))continue;used.add(n);path.push(n);snap('选择 '+n,'加入路径并标记已使用, 进入下一层.');dfs();path.pop();used.delete(n);snap('撤销 '+n,'返回上一层, 恢复 '+n+' 为可选, 继续尝试同层的其他数字.');}\n}\ndfs();snap('遍历完成','生成 6 个排列. 时间 O(n·n!), 除输出外空间 O(n).');\nlet index=0;\nfunction arrText(a){return '['+a.join(', ')+']'}\nfunction render(s){\n document.getElementById('step').textContent='步骤 '+(index+1)+' / '+stages.length+' · '+s.t;\n document.getElementById('numbers').innerHTML=[1,2,3].map(n=>{const used=s.p.includes(n);return '<div class=\"box '+(used?'used':'available')+'\"><span class=\"num\">'+n+'</span><span class=\"label\">'+(used?'路径中':'可选')+'</span></div>'}).join('');\n let frames=[];\n frames.push('<div class=\"frame '+(s.p.length===0?'active':'')+'\"><div class=\"depth\">深度 0</div><div class=\"path\">[]</div></div>');\n s.p.forEach((n,i)=>frames.push('<div class=\"frame '+(i===s.p.length-1?'active':'')+'\"><div class=\"depth\">深度 '+(i+1)+' · '+n+'</div><div class=\"path\">'+arrText(s.p.slice(0,i+1))+'</div></div>'));\n document.getElementById('frames').innerHTML=frames.join('');\n document.getElementById('action').textContent=s.a;\n document.getElementById('answers').innerHTML=allAnswers.map((a,i)=>'<div class=\"answer '+(i<s.c?'done ':'')+(i===s.c-1&&s.p.length===3?'current':'')+'\"><span class=\"mono\">'+arrText(a)+'</span></div>').join('');\n document.getElementById('count').textContent=s.c+' / 6';\n}\nrender(stages[index]);\nsetInterval(()=>{index=(index+1)%stages.length;render(stages[index])},1900);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": "",
  "time_complexity": "O(n·n!)",
  "space_complexity": "O(n)",
  "complexity_note": "n 是互不相同的元素数. 有 n! 个排列, 每次复制完整路径需要 O(n); 路径、已使用集合和递归栈均为 O(n). 不含 O(n·n!) 的答案集合."
}
